<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-15T23:44:51.846Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 23:44:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian forces have captured a key town in Tigray along with its regional airport and are advancing toward an Eritrean border town, while intense fighting in Amhara has left at least 183 dead, according to the UN. The United States has increased diplomatic pressure, urging Ethiopia and Eritrea to de-escalate as the conflict spreads. Leaders of Egypt, Eritrea, Sudan and Somalia are meeting to coordinate security operations if the fighting crosses borders. The war caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQb3J5Sk1xdnNwNXYtQnlMOVhHU1l6SDdRUjZXenFGQWxLWVN3LWV5eXdfVWdWY0xfT1B3aU9GTEw4YUlVNndBZldKR3hQNkZ1M1BaTGR2YUp2RUE2NFZZWWdQQ08td2dfbmhqYkc3YkZtdk1aTTRaazBkRGs3WjBVMWhkc2ozX2hIel9qUG16QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOUzg5bHdMQnB0TTJENDN5Sk0tUlpTTG5Lb1AzY2ZCaEpmaV9fTVQzMWtRMXdWX2RnczBRZ1h0UXY0UW14eTdQSlh0RURMQWRNYkUtZGRfaVZMaVZQSnp0MXZla2JPbFM2cENMV3RjUnRxOXhKc1Bsc1JPcmNhcWlCTVA5MGtZNk9FQmxWSlU5UG9HQkNiNDFsaEdSTzVBaXlGZFlEUFhhRkszWlNkRi1BaDB0T2JHckIy0gG-AUFVX3lxTFBQclR3dlVGRktnOWlnOXB3aG9oSE4tY0w0bjBJeG9IX3daX3ZzQkJQd0VaMDhKY1BnRFBEQ0daUnRURzdoSjk5QThEOWNfenlzWGI2MkNoUzM4eFpIWDVQWGZJRW50OTZiRWRIWVAyY0xwSWxKejkwTll3RmNicURLTUhDc2ttLVFmNW44MEZxdXctTDEzS1hackNMdkQzMFBEUlU5aWZIUkR2Y3o0dWJJMTFheVg4MFROd3FXNFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sunday Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQb2FQTWlGMzdwSWxvMmdvRDNvc290Qkk2bnpjbkxIaU5UZUVrXzZPbWgzR3JuQ2dPOXkyYlk1VjhMNl8teWJ3aE41UFFLS0pnYlB1ZGEwS0lPYzJYcWRkVjZwdkw3NEgtUXFwZm5jdDd3cXVxdlZCMnEwTDNway1tZmZtMXhjWFl0RmtOTlFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.